      "text": "Congratulations to the five newest Ground Tactical Air Controllers (GTAC) of Air and Marine Operations who graduated last week! Your dedication, training, and commitment to excellence have prepared you for a critical role in protecting our nation.\n \nGTACs serve as the vital link between ground operations and air assets, coordinating real-time operations to ensure mission success. They are responsible for directing air resources during tactical operations, providing situational awareness, and enhancing the effectiveness and safety of law enforcement and homeland security missions.\n \nWe applaud your achievement and look forward to your contributions in safeguarding our borders and communities. Welcome to the team!",
